message.content:
**Next action:** Set east and west signals to green (to clear the growing east queue), and ensure north and south remain red or change to red if needed.

```json
{
  "set_east_signal": {"colour": "green"},
  "set_west_signal": {"colour": "green"},
  "set_north_signal": {"colour": "red"},
  "set_south_signal": {"colour": "red"}
}
```

**Next actions:** Set east signal to green (to clear its growing queue of 7), and set the other three signals to red.

```json
{
  "tool_calls": [
    {"name": "set_east_signal", "args": {"colour": "green"}},
    {"name": "set_north_signal", "args": {"colour": "red"}},
    {"name": "set_south_signal", "args": {"colour": "red"}},
    {"name": "set_west_signal", "args": {"colour": "red"}}
  ]
}
```

**Next action: Set EW green (West priority)**

```json
{
  "tool_calls": [
    {"tool": "set_north_signal", "args": {"colour": "red"}},
    {"tool": "set_south_signal", "args": {"colour": "red"}},
    {"tool": "set_east_signal", "args": {"colour": "green"}},
    {"tool": "set_west_signal", "args": {"colour": "green"}}
  ]
}
```
